    "created_at": "2023-03-23T14:25:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-23T14:25:04Z",
    "body": "> But would display:none or hidden, for example, be counted as well? What if a popover invoker is not on the screen\r\n\r\nI don't think that style and layout things like this should affect whether an invoker is considered valid. The current algorithms only look at DOM state like connectedness, position in the tree, and attributes.",
